              runtime-only null line.
            - Decision (agent, 2026-11-09): R9, a separate `Defect` verdict kind (proposed name), extended to overruns,
              dead children and unknown ids. **Why:** makes R7 and case-only kills checkable and keeps R8 a function of
              code, case and seed. **Reverse:** report a defect as a failure.
